RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchIntro:: @ 8184320
	.string "Oh! {PLAYER}! Welcome back to my GYM.\p"
	.string "Since our battle, I've continued my\n"
	.string "studies and made my POKéMON\l"
	.string "even stronger.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchAsk:: @ 81843C0
	.string "Would you like to have a rematch?$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchDecline:: @ 8184400
	.string "I understand. Come back anytime you'd\n"
	.string "like to battle.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchAccept:: @ 8184448
	.string "Excellent! Let's begin!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchDefeat:: @ 8184490
	.string "I still have more to learn...\p"
	.string "Your strength continues to inspire me\n"
	.string "to study even harder!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneGiveHardStone:: @ 81844E8
	.string "Please accept this as a token of my\n"
	.string "appreciation.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneExplainHardStone:: @ 8184520
	.string "The HARD STONE is a hold item that\n"
	.string "powers up ROCK-type moves.\p"
	.string "I hope we can battle again sometime!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneRematchPostBattle:: @ 8184590
	.string "Thank you for the battle! I've learned\n"
	.string "so much from you.$"
